(text "NUCLEO-L476RG / Nokia 5110 Breakout carrier - rev A" (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c8148f8a-9eaa-5bdc-a2b4-87db645a9169"))
(text "USB power via Nucleo ST-LINK. CN6 supplies separate +5V and +3V3 rails.\nJ1/J2/J3 fit on BOTTOM and plug into Nucleo CN5/CN6/CN9.\nKeep ST-LINK, target and Arduino connectors at manufacturer default settings." (at 25.4 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6884e37d-2fb4-56aa-9a3d-ff6dfeb6cc86"))
(text "DISPLAY: JOY-IT SBC-LCD84x48 REV2 ONLY\n1 GND, 2 LIGHT (active low), 3 VCC, 4 CLK,\n5 DIN, 6 DC, 7 CE, 8 RST.\nSupply and all logic 3.3V. REV1 differs." (at 137.16 87.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fc368a5f-f2b3-5fb9-bdcd-6c072819acd4"))
(text "SENSOR: ADAFRUIT 3942 / HC-SR04\n1 VCC (+5V), 2 TRIG (3.3V accepted),\n3 ECHO (5V output), 4 GND.\nDo not connect 5V ECHO to the LCD rail." (at 264.16 87.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6ba12961-59cd-5e39-be53-d56757fc1d34"))
(text "ECHO divider: 10k upper / 18k lower, both 1%.\n5.0V input -> 3.214V at PB10 nominal.\nAt 5.25V and resistor corners: <=3.399V.\nR2 holds PB10 low with a disconnected sensor." (at 264.16 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21ae71eb-b3d6-5ba8-9e72-bf8172c9d99e"))
(text "CN5: 1 D8/PA9, 2 D9/PC7, 3 D10/PB6,\n4 D11/PA7, 6 D13/PA5, 7 GND.\nCN6: 4 +3V3, 5 +5V, 6/7 GND.\nCN9: 7 D6/PB10, 8 D7/PA8.\nAll other contacts intentionally isolated." (at 25.4 196.85 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6567cda1-eec6-5a84-9b36-41b04e7723ea"))
(text "90 x 66 x 1.6mm, two copper layers, four M2.5 mounts.\nJ4/J5 and passives on TOP. C1 close to J4; C2/C3 close to J5.\nPurchased Nucleo, display, sensor, cables and hardware: assembly BOM.\nEngineering candidate: physical assembly and bench qualification pending." (at 137.16 249 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0951a5a-52df-581a-a943-87b78a5723e8"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
